@startuml ConcurrencyView_Consistency

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam noteBorderColor gray
skinparam noteBackgroundColor lightyellow

' Define views
component "Concurrency View" as CV #LightCyan
component "Functional View" as FV #LightGreen
component "Deployment View" as DV #LightBlue
component "Information View" as IV #LightPink
component "Development View" as DevV #LightGray

' Layout direction
left to right direction

' Connections and notes
CV -- FV : "must map to and align with"
note on link
    - Functional elements must map to concurrency units.
    - Interactions must match IPC mechanisms.
    - State transitions must support functional behavior.
end note

CV -- DV : "must be deployable on"
note on link
    - Process structure must fit deployment hardware.
    - Concurrency scaling must align with infrastructure.
    - Network patterns must be supported.
end note

CV -- IV : "must respect data semantics"
note on link
    - Access/control must match data models.
    - State models must match entity lifecycles.
    - Real-time flows must follow data constraints.
end note

CV -- DevV : "must align with implementation"
note on link
    - Concurrency patterns must be implementable.
    - Modules must support concurrency units.
    - Thread safety must be upheld by dev standards.
end note

@enduml
